<div class="beauty">
  <div class="beauty-content">
    <h2 class="reveal">Why we made it beautiful.</h2>
    <p class="reveal">
      Most AI hardware is a black plastic puck. It works, but it doesn't belong.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      AI lives close to us — on our bodies, on our desks, in the homes of the
      people we love. It deserves the same care we give the things we already
      keep around us. A wedding ring. A reading lamp. A favorite coat.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal accent">
      So we made Fountain something you would choose, not just tolerate.
      <em>The materials, the weight, the finish.</em> The thinking shows.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .beauty {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    padding: clamp(48px, 10vh, 120px) clamp(24px, 8vw, 128px);
  }
  .beauty-content {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .beauty-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .beauty-content p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 60ch;
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-ink) 92%, transparent);
  }
  .beauty-content .accent {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(19px, 1.9vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .beauty-content .accent em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 1000ms var(--ease-out-refined),
                transform 1000ms var(--ease-out-refined);
  }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 160ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 320ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 500ms; }
</style>
